    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 9,
      "title": "autoconfig 控制面详情(点击展开:卡死探测 / reconcile / apiserver)",
      "collapsed": true,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22
      },
      "panels": [
        {
          "type": "timeseries",
          "id": 6,
          "title": "autoconfig 卡死探测(队列积压 / 未完成时长)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "description": "健康时三条都贴 0。【未完成时长持续上涨且不归零 = reconcile 卡死】(如 cart ConfigMap wedge:peer 不更新但进程活着、探针全绿、restartCount 恒 0)。队列积压持续 >0 = 处理速度跟不上入队。只统计 leader 副本。",
          "gridPos": {
            "h": 8,
            "w": 8,
            "x": 0,
            "y": 23
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "refId": "A",
              "expr": "sum((workqueue_depth{job=~\"autoconfig.*\"}\n     and on(pod) (leader_election_master_status{job=~\"autoconfig.*\"} == 1)))",
              "legendFormat": "队列积压",
              "datasource": {
                "type": "prometheus",
                "uid": "prometheus"
              }
            },
            {
              "refId": "B",
              "expr": "sum((workqueue_unfinished_work_seconds{job=~\"autoconfig.*\"}\n     and on(pod) (leader_election_master_status{job=~\"autoconfig.*\"} == 1)))",
              "legendFormat": "当前调谐已跑(秒)",
              "datasource": {
                "type": "prometheus",
                "uid": "prometheus"
              }
            },
            {
              "refId": "C",
              "expr": "sum((workqueue_longest_running_processor_seconds{job=~\"autoconfig.*\"}\n     and on(pod) (leader_election_master_status{job=~\"autoconfig.*\"} == 1)))",
              "legendFormat": "最久处理(秒)",
              "datasource": {
                "type": "prometheus",
                "uid": "prometheus"
              }
            }
          ],
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "unit": "short",
              "custom": {
                "drawStyle": "line",
                "fillOpacity": 12,
                "showPoints": "never",
                "lineWidth": 1
              },
              "min": 0
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "options": {
            "legend": {
              "displayMode": "list",
              "placement": "bottom",
              "showLegend": true
            },
            "tooltip": {
              "mode": "multi",
              "sort": "desc"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "timeseries",
          "id": 7,
          "title": "autoconfig reconcile(次/分)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "description": "result=requeue_after 是常态 —— 每次调谐结束都预约 resyncEvery(10s)后再跑一轮(informer 事件之外的兜底重扫),所以【空转也有稳定速率,不代表配置在变】,稳态约 16 次/分。判断有没有真失败看 errors 这条(应恒 0);retries_total 会跟着 requeue 涨,不是失败次数。",
          "gridPos": {
            "h": 8,
            "w": 8,
            "x": 8,
            "y": 23
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "refId": "A",
              "expr": "60 * sum by(result)((rate(controller_runtime_reconcile_total{job=~\"autoconfig.*\"}[$__rate_interval])\n     and on(pod) (leader_election_master_status{job=~\"autoconfig.*\"} == 1)))",
              "legendFormat": "{{result}}",
              "datasource": {
                "type": "prometheus",
                "uid": "prometheus"
              }
            },
            {
              "refId": "B",
              "expr": "60 * sum((rate(controller_runtime_reconcile_errors_total{job=~\"autoconfig.*\"}[$__rate_interval])\n     and on(pod) (leader_election_master_status{job=~\"autoconfig.*\"} == 1)))",
              "legendFormat": "errors",
              "datasource": {
                "type": "prometheus",
                "uid": "prometheus"
              }
            }
          ],
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "unit": "short",
              "custom": {
                "drawStyle": "line",
                "fillOpacity": 12,
                "showPoints": "never",
                "lineWidth": 1
              },
              "min": 0
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "options": {
            "legend": {
              "displayMode": "list",
              "placement": "bottom",
              "showLegend": true
            },
            "tooltip": {
              "mode": "multi",
              "sort": "desc"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "timeseries",
          "id": 8,
          "title": "autoconfig → apiserver(次/分 · 按状态码)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "description": "controller 对【k8s kube-apiserver】的调用(list/watch ModelRoute、读写 ConfigMap、查 Pod/EndpointSlice、续 Lease),与推理服务无关。出现 429 = 被 APF 限流,此时调谐会变慢甚至堆积。",
          "gridPos": {
            "h": 8,
            "w": 8,
            "x": 16,
            "y": 23
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "refId": "A",
              "expr": "60 * sum by(code)((rate(rest_client_requests_total{job=~\"autoconfig.*\"}[$__rate_interval])\n     and on(pod) (leader_election_master_status{job=~\"autoconfig.*\"} == 1)))",
              "legendFormat": "{{code}}",
              "datasource": {
                "type": "prometheus",
                "uid": "prometheus"
              }
            }
          ],
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "unit": "short",
              "custom": {
                "drawStyle": "line",
                "fillOpacity": 12,
                "showPoints": "never",
                "lineWidth": 1
              },
              "min": 0
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "options": {
            "legend": {
              "displayMode": "list",
              "placement": "bottom",
              "showLegend": true
            },
            "tooltip": {
              "mode": "multi",
              "sort": "desc"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 10,
      "title": "历史",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "id": 11,
      "title": "历史服务状态(绿=全就绪 / 橙=部分就绪 / 红=无就绪)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "值 = 就绪副本 / 【期望】副本(百分比),鼠标划过看该 service 该时刻的就绪比例 —— 100%=全就绪(绿) / 0<x<100%=降级(橙,数字即降级程度) / 0%=无就绪(红)。未合并相邻同值,所以 tooltip 时刻≈鼠标位置;精确的 ready/total 个数看下方「历史副本数」(已开共享 tooltip,hover 会同步弹出)或最上面那张表。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "clamp_max((sum by(service)(avg by(service, route)(label_replace(bodylog_service_replicas_ready{service=~\"$service\",service!=\"unknown\"}, \"service\", \"$1\", \"service\", \"(.*)-leader$\")))) / clamp_min((sum by(service)(avg by(service, route)(label_replace(bodylog_service_replicas_desired{service=~\"$service\",service!=\"unknown\"}, \"service\", \"$1\", \"service\", \"(.*)-leader$\")))\n  or sum by(service)(avg by(service, route)(label_replace(bodylog_service_replicas{service=~\"$service\",service!=\"unknown\"}, \"service\", \"$1\", \"service\", \"(.*)-leader$\")))), 1), 1)",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 80
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN 无就绪副本",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP 全部就绪",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "range",
              "options": {
                "from": 1e-06,
                "to": 0.999999,
                "result": {
                  "color": "orange",
                  "index": 2
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1e-06
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showValue": "never",
        "mergeValues": false,
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none",
          "hideZeros": false
        },
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 12,
      "title": "历史副本数(期望/就绪,随扩缩实时)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "每 service 后端 pod 数随时间(扩缩容动态);desired=期望副本(虚线,工作负载 spec.replicas),ready=就绪(实线),同 service 同色且图例里相邻。**两线贴合=健康,ready 掉到 desired 之下=降级**。不画 EndpointSlice 的实际数:滚动更新的 maxSurge 会让它鼓包,是正常 surge 不是降级,画出来只会干扰(要看实际数去上面的表格)。tooltip=multi(鼠标在图里任意高度都列出该时刻全部值)。-leader 已并入。已删/改名服务旧名字随 retention 老化。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 32
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "((sum by(service)(avg by(service, route)(label_replace(bodylog_service_replicas_desired{service=~\"$service\",service!=\"unknown\",service=\"kimi/kimi-k25\"}, \"service\", \"$1\", \"service\", \"(.*)-leader$\")))\n  or sum by(service)(avg by(service, route)(label_replace(bodylog_service_replicas{service=~\"$service\",service!=\"unknown\",service=\"kimi/kimi-k25\"}, \"service\", \"$1\", \"service\", \"(.*)-leader$\")))))\n  and on(service) (count by(service)(last_over_time(bodylog_service_replicas{service!=\"unknown\"}[10m] @ end())))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} desired",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "(sum by(service)(avg by(service, route)(label_replace(bodylog_service_replicas_ready{service=~\"$service\",service!=\"unknown\",service=\"kimi/kimi-k25\"}, \"service\", \"$1\", \"service\", \"(.*)-leader$\"))))\n  and on(service) (count by(service)(last_over_time(bodylog_service_replicas{service!=\"unknown\"}[10m] @ end())))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} ready",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "((sum by(service)(avg by(service, route)(label_replace(bodylog_service_replicas_desired{service=~\"$service\",service!=\"unknown\",service=\"modelforge/fallback-modelforge-01\"}, \"service\", \"$1\", \"service\", \"(.*)-leader$\")))\n  or sum by(service)(avg by(service, route)(label_replace(bodylog_service_replicas{service=~\"$service\",service!=\"unknown\",service=\"modelforge/fallback-modelforge-01\"}, \"service\", \"$1\", \"service\", \"(.*)-leader$\")))))\n  and on(service) (count by(service)(last_over_time(bodylog_service_replicas{service!=\"unknown\"}[10m] @ end())))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} desired",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "expr": "(sum by(service)(avg by(service, route)(label_replace(bodylog_service_replicas_ready{service=~\"$service\",service!=\"unknown\",service=\"modelforge/fallback-modelforge-01\"}, \"service\", \"$1\", \"service\", \"(.*)-leader$\"))))\n  and on(service) (count by(service)(last_over_time(bodylog_service_replicas{service!=\"unknown\"}[10m] @ end())))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} ready",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "E",
          "expr": "((sum by(service)(avg by(service, route)(label_replace(bodylog_service_replicas_desired{service=~\"$service\",service!=\"unknown\",service!~\"kimi/kimi-k25|modelforge/fallback-modelforge-01\"}, \"service\", \"$1\", \"service\", \"(.*)-leader$\")))\n  or sum by(service)(avg by(service, route)(label_replace(bodylog_service_replicas{service=~\"$service\",service!=\"unknown\",service!~\"kimi/kimi-k25|modelforge/fallback-modelforge-01\"}, \"service\", \"$1\", \"service\", \"(.*)-leader$\")))))\n  and on(service) (count by(service)(last_over_time(bodylog_service_replicas{service!=\"unknown\"}[10m] @ end())))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} desired",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "F",
          "expr": "(sum by(service)(avg by(service, route)(label_replace(bodylog_service_replicas_ready{service=~\"$service\",service!=\"unknown\",service!~\"kimi/kimi-k25|modelforge/fallback-modelforge-01\"}, \"service\", \"$1\", \"service\", \"(.*)-leader$\"))))\n  and on(service) (count by(service)(last_over_time(bodylog_service_replicas{service!=\"unknown\"}[10m] @ end())))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} ready",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "lineWidth": 1
          },
          "min": 0
